kdensity TFP_OLS_29
sum ln_TFP_OLS_29, d
replace ln_TFP_OLS_29=. if !inrange(ln_TFP_OLS_29,r(p1),r(p99))

* generate TFP estimates with Levinsohn-Petrin (ACF correction) for France, Spain in sector 13 & 29

xi: prodest ln_real_VA if sector==13 & inlist(country,"France","Spain"), met(lp) free(ln_L i.year) proxy(ln_real_M) state(ln_real_K) va acf
